{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And I will set My dwelling.</b> And you shall not fear that you will ever come to loss, for My glory dwells among you, and it is not like a human being whose soul wearies to dwell continuously in one place. And behold, I will be for you as Elohim and you are My people, for therefore I brought you out from the land of Egypt. And furthermore, when you go to the land of your enemies and the Temple is not with you, My glory walks in your midst."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:12:37.387794400Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}